         body='// Hunts: the four hypotheses, and the numbers behind each\ndouble median = median(Arrays.stream(perDay)\n        .asDoubleStream().toArray());\ndouble mad = median(Arrays.stream(perDay)\n        .mapToDouble(v -> Math.abs(v - median)).toArray());\nreturn new Volume(perDay, median, mad,\n        median + deviations * Math.max(mad, 1));',
